OL,3,ADerry firm becomes one of UK's biggest
OL,4,Acar park operators after buying NCP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Londonderry company has become one of
OL,7,Fthe UK's biggest car park operators
OL,8,Fafter buying NCP out of administration.
OL,10,FThe deal means the Martin Group will
OL,11,Fcontrol more than 100 sites.
OL,13,FThe NCP business collapsed in March
OL,14,F2026 after a sustained period of
OL,15,Fdeclining performance left it unable to
OL,16,Fpay its debts.
OL,18,FAt that time some of its sites were
OL,19,Fclosed or transferred to other
OL,20,Foperators.
